{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalQConnection","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalQConnection","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Linear.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.nabla_q_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.nabla_q_classical","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L76-L85","doc":"At `q = 1`, the q-connection reduces to the classical connection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.nabla_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.nabla_q","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L68-L74","doc":"The q-deformed connection morphism `∇_q : A → A ⊗ Ω¹`.\n\n`∇_q = q⁻¹ · ∇ + (1 − q⁻¹) · (ξ ⌟ ∇) · θ` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.q_mul_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.q_mul_inv","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L66-L66","doc":"`q_inv` is a two-sided inverse of `q` in `R_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.q_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.q_inv","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L64-L64","doc":"The inverse `q⁻¹` as an element of the ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]`.\n(`R_q` is not a field, so `q⁻¹` is carried as an explicit element\nsatisfying `q * q_inv = 1`, e.g. `q_param` and `q_inv_param`.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.q","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The deformation parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.theta_nabla","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.theta_nabla","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The canonical 1-form `θ_A` as a morphism `A → A ⊗ Ω¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.xi_contract_nabla","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.xi_contract_nabla","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The contracted connection `ξ ⌟ ∇`, abstractly a morphism `A → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.nabla","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.nabla","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The classical connection `∇ : A → A ⊗ Ω¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.Omega1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.Omega1","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The object of 1-forms `Ω¹` in `C`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.A","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L50-L50","doc":"The Frobenius–Hopf object `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.mk","kind":"ctor","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection","kind":"structure","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L37-L66","doc":"**Categorical q-deformed connection**.\n\nGiven a connection `∇ : A → A ⊗ Ω¹` and the Reeb derivation `ξ`,\nthe q-deformed connection is:\n`∇_q = q⁻¹ · ∇ + (1 − q⁻¹) · (ξ ⌟ ∇) · θ_A`\n\nAt `q = 1`, `∇_q = ∇`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:categorical-q-connection}`\nRef: [kock2004] https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511615443 ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:categorical-q-connection","label":"def:categorical-q-connection","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_param","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.R_q","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection.lean#L29-L31","doc":"Ground ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]` (Laurent polynomials over ℤ).\nSee `QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing` for the compiled definition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}